{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43610","headline":"独在开元寺避暑颇怀鲁望因飞笔联句 · 皮日休","name":"独在开元寺避暑颇怀鲁望因飞笔联句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"烦署虽难避，僧家自有期。\n泉甘於马乳，苔滑似龙漦。\n任诞襟全散，临幽榻旋移。\n松行将雅拜，篁阵欲交麾。\n望塔青𩩉识，登楼白鸽知\n石经森欲动，珠像俨将怡。\n筠簟临杉穗，纱巾透雨丝。\n静谭蝉噪少，凉步鹤随迟。\n烟重回蕉扇，轻风拂桂帷。\n对碑吴地说，开卷梵天词。\n积水鱼梁坏，残花病枕欹。\n怀君潇洒处，孤梦绕罘罳。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43610.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43610","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}